__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
venv/
*.log

# IMPORTANT: db.sqlite3 is intentionally NOT ignored here.
# This project bundles a pre-loaded db.sqlite3 as part of the deployment
# for Vercel (see README.md "Deploying on Vercel" section) - Vercel's
# filesystem is otherwise read-only, so this committed database is how
# the FAQ data gets onto the deployed site at all. Don't add db.sqlite3
# to this file unless you've switched to a hosted database instead.
